  "adaptation": {
    "semantic": null,
    "grammar": "\"nowhere\" carries the negative itself. Many languages use a double negative here (literally \"I don't go nowhere\"); in standard English only one negative is used: *I go nowhere* or *I don't go anywhere*.",
